sequenceDiagram
  actor P as 玩家
  participant S as WorldScene
  participant I as SearchInteraction
  participant V as InventoryPort
  participant E as EventBus
  P->>S: 在搜索点按住 E
  S->>S: 校验范围、视线、光照、前置证据
  alt 条件不满足或松键/移动/受伤
    S->>I: cancel()
    S-->>P: 显示取消原因
  else 条件满足
    S->>I: begin(pointId)
    loop 持续按键
      S->>I: progress()
    end
    S->>I: finish(item, V.addLoot)
    alt 背包满或来源无效
      I-->>S: { ok: false }
      S-->>P: 保留搜索点，提示腾挪空间
    else 成功拾取
      I-->>S: { ok: true }
      S->>E: emit(LocationInteracted)
      S-->>P: 物资进入本局背包
    end
  end
